# Wildgrowth Archaic: "that creature enters with X additional +1/+1 counters" is an effect of the resolved trigger, not of the
# Archaic, so it still applies when the Archaic is gone (CR 113.7a, 614.12). Bot1 casts Grizzly Bears with {G}{R}; the trigger
# resolves; then, with the Bears still on the stack, Bot1 kills its own 1/1 Archaic with Lightning Bolt. The Bears still enter
# with two +1/+1 counters.

